OL,3,GNEWSASea swimmers 'taking control' of
OL,4,Awater quality tests
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis citizen science project is being
OL,7,Ffunded by Southern Water, which has
OL,8,Fspent #25,000 on testing equipment, but
OL,9,Fthe water company is not involved in
OL,10,Fcarrying out the tests.
